{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06241","headline":"西塔寺陆羽茶泉 · 裴迪","name":"西塔寺陆羽茶泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竟陵西塔寺，踪迹尚空虚。\n不独支公住，曾经陆羽居。\n草堂荒产蛤，茶井冷生鱼。\n一汲清泠水，高风味有余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴迪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}